 l'altra e il nucleo familiare, anche grazie alla conoscenza di una famiglia felice e post hippy di camperisti, ritroverà la condivisione di certi ideali nonché il piacere e il gusto di stare insieme.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Una famiglia. Otto ruote. Niente freni.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2006-04-28","status":"Released","rating":5.911,"ratingCount":1860,"genres":["Famiglia","Commedia","Avventura"],"countries":["Germany","United Kingdom","United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"95m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":2157,"name":"Robin Williams","role":"Bob Munro","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lu0gIoH4Bi2CiuMc6WHF9ZIK4PS.jpg"},{"id":57854,"name":"Cheryl Hines","role":"Jamie Munro","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jUW4xdla64Vtq1o2Ob8Oc7MjT9C.jpg"},{"id":57855,"name":"JoJo","role":"Cassie Munro","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tBqc9oC2tw9LMXPQDdl24nsRBKW.jpg"},{"id":27972,"name":"Josh Hutcherson","role":"Carl Munro","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f0eosZ1Fx0VBUyspq8K2f8sUSBn.jpg"},{"id":8447,"name":"Jeff Daniels","role":"Travis Gornicke","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r0mkZJZnTSJO3HJRsMW5HtszxE8.jpg"},{"id":52775,"name":"Kristin Chenoweth","role":"Mary Jo Gornicke","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q3ENDu5n23FARhyij4FVRaTkSg4.jpg"},{"id":35236,"name":"Hunter Parrish","role":"Earl Gornicke","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wFJhOeUeyHJrfkU6lUuHuwDuEaf.jpg"},{"id":978698,"name":"Chloe Sonnenfeld","role":"Moon Gornicke","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/11AEI81hOosbH3QS6HpwIe8apGu.jpg"},{"id":59243,"name":"Alex Ferris","role":"Billy Gornicke","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d5TXrALTXoiYpXXjrCfzD4JzL78.jpg"},{"id":21200,"name":"Will Arnett","role":"Todd Mallory","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cXupYqk2ERP13XBkw816skYdVDO.jpg"},{"id":25147,"name":"Tony Hale","role":"Frank